<http://data.silknow.org/object/2e2a7ca8-6afe-33f8-b2ea-674a7b91f388>
        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Man's breeches of crimson silk taffeta, 1750-70, British"@en , "Man’s breeches made of crimson silk taffeta lined with linen. There are 2 fronts, two backs and 2 waistbands; the back legs are cut higher than the fronts and gathered into the back of the waistbands. There is a watch pocket in the right waistband, a pocket in each side seam and one on each side at the front. The fall front and pocket flaps are combined in one piece, with 5 buttonholes across the top. The breeches close with 3 worked buttonholes and corresponding self-covered buttons (1 remains) at the centre-front of the waistbands. There are two worked eyelets on each waistband at centre back. There are 5 worked buttonholes on each leg with corresponding self-covered buttons (only 2 remain). The knee bands are made to fasten with a buckle."@en ;
        ecrm:P138i_has_representation  <http://data.silknow.org/image/8abc1e43-79bf-3e6b-92e2-9250fffbd490> , <http://data.silknow.org/image/bf263d24-6b38-3c67-9724-181421f682bc> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note               "Man's breeches of crimson silk taffeta, 1750-70, British"@en , "Man’s breeches made of crimson silk taffeta lined with linen. There are 2 fronts, two backs and 2 waistbands; the back legs are cut higher than the fronts and gathered into the back of the waistbands. There is a watch pocket in the right waistband, a pocket in each side seam and one on each side at the front. The fall front and pocket flaps are combined in one piece, with 5 buttonholes across the top. The breeches close with 3 worked buttonholes and corresponding self-covered buttons (1 remains) at the centre-front of the waistbands. There are two worked eyelets on each waistband at centre back. There are 5 worked buttonholes on each leg with corresponding self-covered buttons (only 2 remain). The knee bands are made to fasten with a buckle."@en ;
        ecrm:P43_has_dimension         <http://data.silknow.org/object/2e2a7ca8-6afe-33f8-b2ea-674a7b91f388/dimension/1> , <http://data.silknow.org/object/2e2a7ca8-6afe-33f8-b2ea-674a7b91f388/dimension/3> , <http://data.silknow.org/object/2e2a7ca8-6afe-33f8-b2ea-674a7b91f388/dimension/4> , <http://data.silknow.org/object/2e2a7ca8-6afe-33f8-b2ea-674a7b91f388/dimension/2> ;
